This variation tests DP with exact count of non-overlapping segments and reconstruction, a common analytics pattern.

## Key Concepts
- Non-overlapping subarray DP
- EndHere vs global best states
- Pointer-based reconstruction
- Memory/time trade-offs

## Code Example
```javascript
function maxKSubarrays(A, k){
  const n=A.length, INF=-1e18;
  const dp=Array.from({length:n+1}, ()=>Array(k+1).fill(-INF));
  const end=Array.from({length:n+1}, ()=>Array(k+1).fill(-INF));
  dp[0][0]=0;
  for(let i=1;i<=n;i++){
    for(let t=1;t<=k;t++){
      end[i][t]=Math.max(end[i-1][t]+A[i-1], dp[i-1][t-1]+A[i-1]);
      dp[i][t]=Math.max(dp[i-1][t], end[i][t]);
    }
  }
  return {best: dp[n][k]};
}
```

